<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Kokoro — Lumina Alpha 0.5 | Ripple Forest</title>
<style>
:root{color-scheme:dark;font:15px system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;background:#0a121d;color:#e8f5f8}*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;background:linear-gradient(145deg,#0e1f30,#0a121d 55%)}h1,h2,h3,p{margin:.4em 0}header{max-width:1310px;margin:auto;padding:21px 24px 10px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;align-items:center}small,.muted{color:#a0b5c8}.brand{font-size:29px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.08em}.brand b{color:#79dcdd}main{max-width:1300px;padding:12px 20px 30px;margin:auto;display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(280px,1.25fr) minmax(300px,0.85fr);gap:18px}.stage,.sidebar{background:#101e2e;border:1px solid #345267;border-radius:17px;overflow:hidden}.stage{position:relative;display:flex;justify-content:center;min-height:600px;background:#101a27}.stage canvas{display:block;max-width:100%;height:auto;max-height:82vh;aspect-ratio:1122 / 1402}.meter{position:absolute;top:16px;left:16px;background:#0b1828c9;border:1px solid #416074;padding:7px 11px;border-radius:8px;font-size:11px;pointer-events:none}.sidebar{padding:19px;overflow:auto;max-height:85vh}.section{border-top:1px solid #2e4455;padding-top:14px;margin-top:15px}.row{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px;margin:12px 0}.row input[type=range]{flex:1;width:95px;min-width:80px;accent-color:#80dce4}.row label{font-size:13px;flex:1}button,select{border:1px solid #4c8292;background:#152e42;color:#e0faff;padding:9px 12px;border-radius:8px;cursor:pointer}button:hover{background:#22465c}button:disabled{opacity:.4;cursor:not-allowed}.controls{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:9px}.chip{display:inline-block;background:#1a3645;border-radius:18px;padding:5px 9px;font-size:11px;margin:4px 3px}.meter-color{height:9px;border-radius:7px;background:#172a39;overflow:hidden;flex:2}.meter-color>span{display:block;height:100%;transition:width .2s}.readings{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:8px}.reading{background:#0d1928;border-radius:9px;padding:10px}.reading b{font-size:19px}.reading small{display:block;margin-top:3px;font-size:10px}.alert{font-size:12px;color:#e9c98b;line-height:1.6}footer{max-width:1280px;margin:0 auto;padding:6px 24px 25px;color:#9bb1bd;font-size:12px}a{color:#9cdae0}input[type=file]{max-width:100%}@media(max-width:850px){main{display:flex;flex-direction:column}.sidebar{max-height:none}.stage{min-height:0}.stage canvas{max-height:680px}header{align-items:flex-start;flex-direction:column}}
</style></head><body>
<header><div><div class="brand">KOKORO <b>LUƜINA</b></div><small>FOREST / RIG ENGINEERING ALPHA 0.5 · LOCAL ONLY</small></div><span id="status">Loading artist-derived study rig…</span></header>
<main><section class="stage"><canvas id="scene" width="561" height="701" aria-label="Animated eight-part study rig with hologram effects"></canvas><div class="meter" id="stage-label">REFERENCE CONCEPT · NOT CANONICAL</div></section><aside class="sidebar">
<h2>Rig Control Studio</h2><p class="muted">Eight cutout parts; separate motion, chromatic and light masters. This is a technical study of older concept art, not Kokoro's approved current appearance.</p>
<div class="controls"><button id="pause">Pause</button><button id="snapshot">Export PNG</button><button id="record">Record WebM</button><button id="reset">Reset forest</button></div>
<div class="section"><h3>Independent visual controls</h3>
<div class="row"><label for="look">Gaze / head pose</label><input id="look" type="range" min="-1" max="1" step=".02" value="0"><span id="lookV">0</span></div>
<div class="row"><label for="density">Particle density</label><input id="density" type="range" min="0" max="1" step=".02" value=".64"><span id="densityV">.64</span></div>
<div class="row"><label for="diffusion">Diffusion strength</label><input id="diffusion" type="range" min="0" max="1" step=".02" value=".7"><span id="diffusionV">.7</span></div>
<div class="row"><label for="occlusion">Avatar occlusion</label><input id="occlusion" type="range" min="0" max="1" step=".02" value=".8"><span id="occlusionV">.8</span></div>
<div class="row"><label for="heart">Heart glow (visual)</label><input id="heart" type="range" min="0" max="1" step=".02" value=".7"><span id="heartV">.7</span></div>
<div class="row"><label for="drive">Red signal</label><input id="drive" type="range" min="0" max="1" step=".02" value=".45"><span id="driveV">.45</span></div>
<div class="row"><label for="speech">Speech amplitude</label><input id="speech" type="range" min="0" max="1" step=".02" value=".1"><span id="speechV">.1</span></div>
<div class="row"><label for="skeletal">Display skeleton pivots</label><input type="checkbox" id="skeletal"></div>
</div>
<div class="section"><h3>Ripple chromatic species</h3><p class="muted" style="font-size:12px">"Genes" are software signal mapping configurations, not biological genes or independently intelligent agents.</p><div id="genes"></div><div id="mono" class="chip">Monochrome: not detected</div></div>
<div class="section"><h3>Live data</h3><div class="readings"><div class="reading"><b id="fps">—</b><small>Draw frames/sec (measured)</small></div><div class="reading"><b id="events">0</b><small>Ripple events (computed)</small></div><div class="reading"><b id="q">0</b><small>Ripple-Q symbol (computed)</small></div><div class="reading"><b id="elapsed">0</b><small>Simulation time (seconds)</small></div></div><div id="audit" class="alert">Signals are simulated or manual software input, not measured cognition or emotion.</div></div>
<div class="section"><h3>Art preservation</h3><p class="muted">Original source poster is included byte-for-byte. Articulation is limited by what was visible in the poster; missing geometry is not invented.</p><a href="data:image/png;base64,